        "tag": "BODY",
        "text": "\n  REA StudioLocal applications · development\n  \n    YOUR WORKSPACELab EditorLab MetricsLab AutomationLab SketchLab NotesLab FlowLab VaultLab ArchiveLab BackupLab SyncFiles and records are stored on this machine.\n    Lab NotesNotes, tags, search and exportDevelopment version. Full product feature parity and comparative improvements are still being evaluated.Local NotesWrite Markdown notes, organize notebooks and tags, search, export and restore versions.All tagsowned-cancel-browserAll notebooksOwned Cancel Parent · e5f135Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · 954138Show trash SearchNew noteExport notes JSONExport Joplin JEXNotebooksOrganize notebooks or move a notebook with its descendants to trash. Restoring also restores independently trashed descendant notes. Save your draft first.Owned Cancel Parent (0 notes)— Owned Cancel Child (1 notes)Choose a notebookOwned Cancel Parent · e5f135  Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · 954138Top levelOwned Cancel Parent · e5f135  Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · 954138Create notebookRename notebookMove notebookMove notebook to trashRestore notebookUnfiledOwned Cancel Parent · e5f135  Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · 954138Move saved note1 notesOwned Attachment Note · Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · owned-cancel-browserOwned synthetic attached-note body.Note draftNotes (created when saved)UnfiledOwned Cancel Parent · e5f135  Owned Cancel Parent / Owned Cancel Child · 954138Save noteMove to trashRestore noteExport MarkdownAttachmentsSave your draft first. Attachments are stored locally and included in JEX exports. Maximum file size: 4 MiB.Safe Markdown previewPrevious saved versionsImport notes or Joplin JEXJEX preserves supported note IDs, notebook hierarchy, tags, metadata and attachments. Existing ID collisions reject the entire import. Maximum JEX size: 8 MiB. JSON creates note copies and excludes binaries.Notes are saved locally when you choose Save.\n  \n  \n\n\n"
